<h2>Welcome to BitHub <%= @resource.name || @resource.email %></h2>

<p>Creating a social hub via BitHub is quick and easy. Here is how to do it:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Log in to your BitHub User: www.bithub.com</li>
	<li>Click on “Add Hub”</li>
	<li>Name your hub</li>
	<li>Add Services such as Twitter or Facebook.</li>
	<li>Add moderation rules</li>
	<li>Select Integration &amp; Design to find the hub code and quick link for your hub.</li>
	<li>Place the hub code in your page to showcase your hub to everyone!</li>
</ul>

<p><b>Before you start using Bithub please <%= link_to 'confirm your user', confirmation_url(@resource, confirmation_token: @token) %>.</b></p> 

<p>Check out our online support topics at the bottom right of the page or email us at <a href="mailto:support@bithub.com">support@bithub.com</a> with any questions.</p>

<p>Looking forward to seeing your customized hub!</p>
